roup for an EXP boost","path":"/game/10758405460-killjoy-infection","slug":"10758405460-killjoy-infection","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9f3678cb679531e2d5426b175c50f70745f1f2e2e697e075a1ea49018c3ff123.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-931f872a0caafee8f8d4a7b1c957b888/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":9285002,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-09-21T05:03:00.449Z","creator":{"name":"thunderdos31","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11229338319,"name":"[🏆] The Donation Game!","desc":"🏆 Welcome to KreekCraft's Official Donation Game! 🏆\n\nAs of May 29th, 2026, Roblox has officially stopped cross-game transactions. Our entire game relied on any user being able to donate to anyone, so this forced us to shut down. Thank you to all of our players who supported us. We genuinely couldn't have done it without you.","path":"/game/11229338319-the-donation-game","slug":"11229338319-the-donation-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0aad534a545864ba84bfbf7dbd867f6ec23a4d2b110592504d9218d3425ea88f.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-cc22a9356452bc193b77a779f9259c64/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":22895458,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-25T12:25:40.669Z","creator":{"name":"omelette prep","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":10701984492,"name":"Orangutag! 🦧","desc":"We are working on a new game called \"Monke Tag\" which will be the sequel to Orangutag.\n\nFAQ:\nQ: Will Orangutag still be updated?\nA: Only for bug updates, but no new content updates.\n\nQ: When will Monke Tag be released?\nA: We have no release date as of now. If we do we will update this page to let you know :) For now we're still developing the game.\n\nQ: Will Monke Tag be different than Orangutag?\nA: Yes, so far they are absolutely nothing alike and Monke Tag will have more unique features.\n\nQ: What can I expect from Monke Tag?\nA: You can expect things like an Item Shop, Accessories, Game Modes, and we plan on adding much more!\n(When we say \"Accessories\" we're not talking about Avatar/Roblox Accessories) ","path":"/game/10701984492-orangutag","slug":"10701984492-orangutag","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/c9cf633e13e653a98b7b1b5cf1cd31aaf5c65206ae5b5c8f3e32e456874bbdcd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f4f272854b2bee1a9719f9d6ce72830a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":18243365,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-06-03T16:37:32.075Z","creator":{"name":"Superluminal","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":12101311141,"name":"[Check description] Friday Night Partying","desc":"You see, we're moving to a new place due to some complications we've had lately; if you want to keep playing FNP, just go here: \nhttps://www.roblox.com/games/97923943452128/Friday-Night-Partying\nor, another way to keep playing is simply to join here; it will take you directly to the new place","path":"/game/12101311141-friday-night-partying","slug":"12101311141-friday-night-partying","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/19ab82633f8ed94169c51d310c65fb31cd84c852a60e2bd144ab1176ee90ef1a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f0f4705848d91a5b23e17f31d5215d4b/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":106225977,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-07-13T19:24:42.324Z","creator":{"name":"Party-Central","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":3,"freeCount":3,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":11466522121,"name":"Easy Obby but you get banned if you die!","desc":"🎮 Easy Obby but you get BANNED if you DIE! 😱\n\nWelcome to the easiest obby you’ll ever play... or so you think 👀\n\n😈 One mistake and you're OUT – die once, and you're BANNED for 20 seconds!\n💀 Fall off? Miss a jump? Say goodbye… (temporarily).\n💾 Your stage is automatically saved, even if you leave or get banned!\n\nBut don’t worry — skilled 